DESCRIPTION:Joel Engardio​Why are San Francisco politics so chaotic and 
 confusing?\nFind out with SF Politics 101 by Joel Engardio. Learn what mak
 es our city tick and unpack its million shades of Democratic blue.\nJoel p
 romises the hour will be as fun as your favorite Netflix show.\n\nSF Polit
 ics 101 is an entertaining look at how local politics work and the history
  that shaped San Francisco — brought to life with visuals and narrative 
 storytelling. It’s designed for both newcomers and longtime residents wh
 o want to better understand the city they love.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https:
 //luma.com/wb6qohlx\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-politics-101-4/\n
 Source: Funcheap SF
