BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Bowling
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T200000
DTSTAMP:20261020T084210Z
UID:dothebay-17859460@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our monthly all-ages Queer Bowling event! Come and
  bowl for free while enjoying bites from local food pop ups\, discounted d
 rinks\, DJs\, and drag!\n\nHow it works:\n\n+ Purchasing a ticket will gua
 rantee you entry to the bowling alley. For every ticket sold we donate $10
  to a local nonprofit of our choosing. In 2025 we raised $8k and supported
  the following organizations: Drag Story Hour\, Mujeres Unidas y Activas\,
  San Francisco AIDS Foundation\, Vanguard Lab\, Lyric Center for LGBTQQ+ Y
 outh\, SF Black Pride\, Oaklash\, Sí a la Vida\, Bay Area American Indian
  Two-Spirits\, & more!\n\nYou will also receive a complimentary drink tick
 et for the welcome drink (both alcoholic and non-alcoholic options availab
 le)\n\n+ You will check-in with staff to place your name on the bowling li
 st\n\n+ When we are ready for you\, you will be placed with your group or 
 other guests to bowl on a lane\n\n+ Bowling is FREE!\n\n+ Each lane bowls 
 for 5 frames (you have the opportunity to place your name back on the list
  to bowl again)\n\n+ You will be able to order food or drinks from the bar
 \n\n+ Bowling lanes are for bowlers ONLY. If you are waiting to bowl\, you
  must wait in designated areas until your turn\n\n+ Have fun!\n\nThis even
 t is all ages.\n\n$8\, $10\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10
 /19/queer-bowling-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.763927;-122.4167155
