 , now offers 8 free game tokens for anyone in “the industry” – so we
 ’re assuming barstaff\, restaurant staff\, nightlife staff.\nMonday Nigh
 ts are for the Industry! Every Monday night come join us for some drink sp
 ecials and if you are part of our industry you get 8 tokens!\nFeaturing Co
 nsole Encounters! Get to play some retro games on our 50′ HD screen!\n\n
 Emporium Arcade Bar offers guests a variety of games\, including classic a
 rcade favorites\, pool tables\, pinball\, foosball\, and many more. Their 
 curated bar purveys local craft beer selections\, an innovative cocktail p
 rogram\, boozy slushies\, and an expansive liquor list.\nEmporium Arcade B
 ar’s Industry Night\n616 Divisadero St.\, San Francisco\nEvery Monday | 
 6 pm to 2 am\nFREE with 8 free game tokens for “industry” people\n\nEm
 porium Arcade Bar San Francisco is open daily for guests 21 years or older
 .\nWe’re told “most” games only require one token\, so that’s four
  games you can play for free every Monday night.\n\nEmporium Arcade Bar is
  the quintessentially cool place to hang out and have a good time. Origina
 lly launched in Chicago in 2012\, Emporium now has six locations: three in
  Chicago (Wicker Park\, Fulton Market\, and Logan Square)\, two in the Bay
  Area (San Francisco and O...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://emporiumsf.com/\
 nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-arcade-bar-emporium-8-free-game-token
 s-for-industry-night-every-monday-166/\nSource: Funcheap SF
