DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSuzy Kopf\n\nJoin artist Suzy 
 Kopf in making tissue paper marigold garlands to celebrate Día de los Mue
 rtos or Day of the Dead.\n\nJoin artist Suzy Kopf in making tissue paper m
 arigold garlands to celebrate Día de los Muertos or Day of the Dead. This
  is a simple paper flower craft that adults and children can enjoy\, inten
 ded to honor loved ones whom have died.\n\nDay of the Dead is an annual pr
 e-hispanic Indigenous holiday occurring in early November each year during
  which people build altars for their gods and the deceased. Designed to we
 lcome souls back to the living world\, most altars are heavily adorned wit
 h marigolds either alive or fake.\nSpend a relaxing evening at SeaLevel en
 joying seasonal snacks and leave with your own garland to decorate your ho
 me and bring brightness into the coming season. All supplies are provided.
  Children are welcome with a guardian\, should be able to use scissors saf
 ely.\nPlease note that in an attempt to make this event accessible to all\
 , ticket pricing is on a sliding scale and those able to pay more are subs
 idizing those who are not able to pay as much.\n\n$33.00\n\nTickets: https
 ://www.eventbrite.com/e/make-a-paper-marigold-garland-tickets-200223343410
 0?aff=ebdsoporgprofile#location\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/paper-ma
 rigold-garland-artist-suzy-kopf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/image1
 .png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T205153Z
LOCATION:Sealevel\, 4331 Irving Street San Francisco\, CA 94122
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/paper-marigold-garland-artist-suzy-kopf/
