DESCRIPTION:Jackie FielderEmergency rally at the San Francisco City Hall S
 teps calling on the city to fund immigration services. The rally follows r
 eports of an ICE detention and an additional ICE sighting in San Francisco
 \, as Supervisor Fielder plans to introduce an emergency budget supplement
 al for immigration legal services at the Board of Supervisors meeting.\nOr
 iginal Event Description:\n\nWhat: San Francisco Supervisor Jackie Fielder
  will join fellow Supervisors and immigration legal advocates to announce 
 the introduction of an emergency budget supplemental for immigration legal
  services in light of increased ICE enforcement.\n\nWhen: Tuesday\, Octobe
 r 20\, 2026\, 12:00pm.\n\nWhere: San Francisco City Hall Front Steps\, 1 D
 r. Carlton B. Goodlet Place\n\nSpeakers: Supervisor Jackie Fielder\, Super
 visor Connie Chan\, Supervisor Shamann Walton\, Supervisor Rafael Mandelma
 n\, Supervisor Bilal Mahmood\, Supervisor Danny Sauter\, Supervisor Stephe
 n Sherrill\, La Raza Centro Legal\, and the San Francisco Immigrant Legal 
 and Education Network (SFILEN).\n\nBackground: ICE detained an individual 
 in San Francisco\, Monday\, October 19th\, and community members reported 
 another ICE sighting the same day. Immigration legal service providers are
  under increased demand for legal services. Supervisor Fielder intends to 
 introduce an emergency budget supplemental for immigration legal services 
 at today’s Board of Supervisors meeting.\nTUESDAY OCT. 20\, 2026 12:00PM
 \nBackground: ICE detained an individual in San Francisco Monday...\n\nFre
 e\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/DesUIkdvDJl/?hl=en\nDetails: htt
 ps://sf.funcheap.com/ice-sf-rally-city-hall/\nSource: Funcheap SF
