DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T203000
DTSTAMP:20261018T205153Z
UID:funcheap-1642741@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lectures Workshops
DESCRIPTION:Headshots submitted to Litquake by participantsPart of Litquak
 e’s Words Around the World\nSponsored by Center for the Art of Translati
 on\nCo-presented with Villa Albertine\nIn 2004\, Alain Damasio’s Horde o
 f the Counterwind: An Epic Voyage to the Upper Reaches gained acclaim as F
 rance’s genre-defining sci-fi odyssey of the 21st century\, inspiring th
 e celebrated video game Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 and igniting the imagi
 nations of millions around the world. Now\, this seminal work appears in E
 nglish translation for the very first time\, offering even more readers th
 e opportunity to experience a masterpiece of epic scope and visionary worl
 d-building in which twenty-three adventurers climb endlessly against the w
 ind that plagues their desolate homeland. Their only purpose: identifying 
 the mysterious source where eight centuries of past climbers have tried an
 d failed. Join Damasio and Horde’s English translator\, Alexander Dickow
 \, for a conversation moderated by award-winning writer and translator Edw
 ard Gauvin. Doors at 6:30pm.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.co
 m/e/alain-damasio-horde-of-the-counterwind-tickets-1999616477713?aff=oddtd
 tcreator&amp\;keep_tld=true\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-scifi-a
 uthor-talk-alain-damasios-horde-counterwind-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/57_10_
 20-Alain-Damasio-IG.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T205153Z
LOCATION:Telegraph Hill Books\, 1501 Grant Avenue\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-scifi-author-talk-alain-damasios-horde-co
 unterwind-sf/
