SUMMARY:Intro to Indigo & Shibori Dyeing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T210000
DTSTAMP:20261022T120138Z
UID:dothebay-17628112@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:- Class Time: 7:00PM - 10:00PM\n\nDo you want to enter the wor
 ld of indigo dyeing and shibori dreams? Come and learn the beautiful\, anc
 ient Japanese resist-dyeing technique known as Shibori. In this class\, we
  will teach you the fundamentals of creating an indigo vat using pre-reduc
 ed indigo crystals. Next\, you will explore Shibori techniques to produce 
 those unique patterns for dyeing natural fibers. By using folded\, clamped
 \, tied\, and bound resist techniques\, you'll discover unexpected tie-dye
  designs that highlight each method as you create your beautiful indigo pi
 eces! Each student will receive a set of four items chosen from napkins\, 
 tea towels\, and bandanas\, plus their choice of a tote bag or throw pillo
 wcase. You can mix and match these items to create your perfect set!\n\nSu
 pplies Needed: None\, all will be provided. Make sure to wear something th
 at you don’t mind getting a little messy in. We have aprons also to prot
 ect your clothing.\n\nInstructor Bio: Bea Byrne is a maker\, textile artis
 t\, and instructor located in Oakland\, CA. Hailing originally from the UK
 \, Bea spent time working and teaching in both London and Tokyo before fin
 ally landing in the Bay Area. She offers workshops in many areas of the ap
 parel arts (sewing\, quilting\, embroidery\, jewelry making\, and more)\, 
 as well as consults with artists to help them increase their visibility on
 line and to develop new and additional income streams related to their art
 . To see more of Bea’s wide range of work\, visit https://www...\n\n$73.
 75\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/21/intro-to-indigo-shib
 ori-dyeing-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33409082/ac4a493c-5037-413e-84f6-3c4fad2632aa.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T120138Z
LOCATION:Workshop\, 1310 Haight St\, San Francisco \, CA\, 94115
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/21/intro-to-indigo-shibori-dyeing-
 tickets
END:VEVENT
