BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cherub Dream Records x The Lab: Tricky FM "Twin Star Fantasy" + Ed
 gar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T100000
DTSTAMP:20261023T114720Z
UID:dothebay-17729683@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Buy Tickets\n\nDoors 8pm / Show 8:30pm\n\n$17 / free or discou
 nted for members\n\nTricky FM is the music project and "electronica star" 
 alter ego of Hana Freed. Based out of San Francisco\, she self produces al
 l her own music\, while being a staple in clubs\, venues and punk bars thr
 oughout the Bay Area and beyond. On stage\, Tricky FM is known for her ene
 rgetic and almost performance-art interpretation of the 'pop star'. At hom
 e\, behind her computer\, she's crafted her own brand of euphoric sounding
  electronica. Her work centers on the complex terrain of navigating contem
 porary womanhood: trust\, intimacy\, fulfillment and ultimately the relati
 onship with the self. Her 2023 debut Peace\, Love\, Unity\, Rave (Cherub D
 ream Records) arrived from a place of urgency and anger—a sampled-based 
 Ableton-coded reckoning with the ways misogyny runs through every facet of
  life. This album led her to share stages with Alice Glass\, Molly Nilsson
 \, Mechatok\, Otha\, Spellling\, Salami Rose Joe Louis and more.\n\nHer fo
 rthcoming album Twin Star Fantasy finds Tricky FM on the other side of thi
 s reckoning. Where PLUR was forged in chaos\, Twin Star Fantasy was built 
 in stillness. What fantastical things can be brought forth from the seemin
 gly everyday and mundane? This album weaves reflections on stability and t
 he relationships that shaped her—an homage to the past\, a document of t
 he present\, and a prayer for the future. It shows an artist at the fullne
 ss of her potential\, stepping into a sound that she has been pe...\n\n$17
 \n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/cherub-dream-records-x
 -the-lab-tricky-fm-twin-star-fantasy-edgar-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
