BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:‘INNER WORKINGS’ A Solo Exhibition by Randy Gaul & ‘THE ARTI
 ST BEHIND THE EFFECT’ A Group Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T190000
DTSTAMP:20261018T205153Z
UID:dothebay-17949785@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:‘INNER WORKINGS’\nA Solo Exhibition by Randy Gaul\n\n‘TH
 E ARTIST BEHIND THE EFFECT’\nA Group Exhibition\nCurated By Katharine Ba
 ird\n\n111 Minna Gallery OPENING RECEPTION: Thursday\, October 22nd 2026\n
 \nWe have a double feature of local VFX artists displaying their fine art 
 here at 111 Minna Gallery!!!\n\nOur 2nd Street Gallery will be displaying 
 ‘Inner Workings’\, a solo exhibition by Randy Gaul!\n\nThe Inner Worki
 ngs show\, created by Randy Gaul\, is a collection of artwork that spans d
 ecades of personal work. Within the show are imaginary worlds\, creatures 
 and observations brought together by life experience before the film indus
 try and after. Additional works include furniture\, lights and custom fram
 es made from reclaimed materials from job sites and local surroundings. Ra
 ndy continues in the film industry pitching original content and showing i
 n galleries.\n“My soul as an artist has always existed. My continuing fi
 lm work is but a small portion of my expressive passion as an artist. As t
 he film industry fell into prequels\, sequels and other uninspired project
 s\, it was vital to me to nurture that which has always been there within 
 me. I am now very careful what industry projects I work on and with whom.
 ”\nIn 1998\, Randy Gaul joined Industrial Light & Magic as a concept des
 igner.\n\nPrior to joining ILM\, he worked for seven years as a freelance 
 storyboard and concept artist for such companies as Wild Brain\, MTV and D
 isney\, specializing in creature and character designs as well as environm
 ents...\n\nFree\n111 Minna Gallery Presents\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/10/22/inner-workings-a-solo-exhibition-by-randy-gaul-the-ar
 tist-behind-the-effect-a-group-exhibition-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAls
 o listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/free-vfx-artists-fine-art-double-f
 eature-111-minna-gallery/
GEO:37.7873057;-122.3993712
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34927142/a9674b09-4856-4572-b8bb-335e64c16ee1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T205153Z
LOCATION:111 Minna Gallery\, 111 Minna St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/inner-workings-a-solo-exhibitio
 n-by-randy-gaul-the-artist-behind-the-effect-a-group-exhibition-tickets
