DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 25 years of art\, artists\, and community at Root Di
 vision's 25th Anniversary Benefit Auction!\n\nJoin us on Thursday\, Octobe
 r 22\, for Root Division's largest annual fundraising event\, featuring an
  eclectic mix of high-quality artwork from more than 100 established and e
 merging Bay Area artists. Browse and bid on artwork throughout the evening
 \, with both silent and live auction opportunities\, while celebrating a q
 uarter century of Root Division's impact on San Francisco's creative commu
 nity.\n\nFor 25 years\, Root Division has served as a launchpad for artist
 s at pivotal moments in their careers while creating greater access to art
 s education and creative opportunities in the Bay Area. This milestone eve
 nt brings together artists\, collectors\, and supporters to celebrate wher
 e we've been-and help shape what comes next.\n\nProceeds from the Auction 
 directly support local artists\, free art classes for Bay Area youth\, and
  Root Division's unique model for keeping artists working and thriving in 
 the heart of San Francisco.\n\nCome collect art\, support artists\, and ce
 lebrate 25 years of Root Division!\n\nIN PERSON: Event Tickets: $75\, VIP 
 Tickets: $150\, Host Level: Starting at $400.\n\nPresented by Root Divisio
 n\n\nIN PERSON: $75\, VIP Tickets $150\, Host Level $400+\nRoot Division\n
