 ://go.evvnt.com/3840058-0?pid=12352The Legacy Film Festival on Aging retur
 ns for its 13th annual and 4th virtual edition\, streaming online Friday\,
  October 23 through Sunday\, November 22. Twenty-five documentary and narr
 ative films are organized into six programs: Visionaries\, Bold and Beauti
 ful\, Joy and Delight\, Sharing Is Caring\, Grace and Compassion\, and the
  feature documentary Been Rich All My Life\, about the Silver Belles\, Har
 lem Renaissance chorus dancers still performing in their 80s and 90s. Film
 maker interviews follow select films. Founded in San Francisco in 2012 by 
 Sheila Malkind\, the festival shows later life as adaptation\, growth\, an
