BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yerba Buena Illuminated: Free 95-Ft Art Projection on Market Stree
 t
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1633819@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Yerba Buena Illuminated: Free 95-Ft Art Projection on Market S
 treet\nYerba Buena Partnership\nSan Francisco has officially turned a down
 town building into a giant art projector.\n\nYerba Buena Illuminated launc
 hed Tuesday\, August 25\, 2026 projecting giant digital artworks onto the 
 historic Humboldt Bank Building at 785 Market St.\, at the top of Yerba Bu
 ena Lane. The massive projection covers a 95-foot-high by 46-foot-wide sec
 tion of the building\, turning one of Market Street’s historic facades i
 nto a giant outdoor art screen.\n\nThe free outdoor art show runs nightly 
 from twilight until 10 p.m.\, with the first artwork on view for about 90 
 days. The inaugural projection is Jennifer Steinkamp’s It’s a nice day
  for a white wedding. (2008)\, from SFMOMA’s collection. Inspired by Bil
 ly Idol’s “White Wedding\,” the digital artwork covers the Beaux-Art
 s-style building with a cascade of animated red\, white and yellow wedding
  flowers.\n\nThe project is a collaboration between Yerba Buena Partnershi
 p\, SFMOMA\, the Museum of the African Diaspora and Yerba Buena Center for
  the Arts. And this first installation is just the beginning: MoAD and YBC
 A will curate future projections in 2027\, so the giant building-as-canvas
  is sticking around.\nThe projection is designed to serve as a giant welco
 me sign for the Yerba Buena arts district\, home to more than 60 public ar
 tworks and some of San Francisco’s biggest cultural institutions. The ro
 tating projections will continue to light up the Humboldt Bank Buildi...\n
 \nFree\n\nTickets: https://yerbabuena.org/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.c
 om/yerba-buena-illuminated-free-95-ft-art-projection-on-market-street-19/\
 nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/6avfkp
 PA.jpeg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Humboldt Bank Building\, 785 Market Street\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/yerba-buena-illuminated-free-95-ft-art-project
 ion-on-market-street-19/
END:VEVENT
