BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tyondai Braxton
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T103000
DTSTAMP:20261025T114202Z
UID:dothebay-17387757@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Buy Tickets\n\nDoors 8pm / Show 8:30pm\n\n$23 adv / $25 door /
  free or discounted for members\n\nMember tickets are not yet available fo
 r Fall 2026 Programs\n\nTyondai Braxton’s Splayed Werks is his fifth alb
 um and first full-length release since the recording of his 2018 symphonic
  work Telekinesis. A co-founder of acclaimed experimental rock project Bat
 tles\, among many other achievements\, Braxton’s work spans electroacous
 tic projects and contemporary composition.\n\n—\n\n“My philosophy on r
 eleasing music has changed a lot\, but also my idea of what it means to be
  an artist. The important part of the artist’s job is to archive what yo
 u're doing—what you're excited about\, what you're dealing with\, what y
 ou're reacting against—putting that in a form that documents your life
 … At the moment\, we're all looking out into the world\, dealing with th
 e helplessness in a time of war\, media over-saturation. What's the role o
 f the artist in that? I think the archiving of any particular creative ide
 a in the moment is one of the most significant things an artist can do now
 . Things I previously thought were important—’this piece means so much
  to me\,’ or ‘listen to how this chord arrived’—are actually much 
 less so.”\n\nEven at first blush\, Splayed Werks\, Tyondai Braxton’s f
 ifth album\, his first full-length release since the recording of his 2018
  symphonic work\, Telekinesis\, reveals itself as unlike what came before 
 and marks the beginning of a new chapter with UK label Erased Tapes. First
  off\, there’s a lot...\n\n$23\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2
 026/10/24/tyondai-braxton-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.765289;-122.418493
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32262368/c379281a-eff9-4146-92a7-3e21a3a1ff0d.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261025T114202Z
LOCATION:The Lab\, 2948 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/tyondai-braxton-tickets
END:VEVENT
