UID:dothebay-17979913@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Genentech Presents\nLeap’s 44th Annual Sandcastle Classic\nS
 aturday\, October 24 | Ocean Beach\n\nSince 1983\, Leap has hosted the ico
 nic Sandcastle Classic\, Northern California’s largest sandcastle compet
 ition\, to raise funds for Bay Area arts education programs. This unique s
 andcastle competition\, nonprofit fundraiser\, and community event brings 
 over 5\,000 people to San Francisco’s Ocean Beach every year to design a
 nd construct creative sand sculptures on an impressive scale\, with local 
 students.\n\n2026 marks the 44th annual Sandcastle Classic\, the biggest s
 andcastle competition in Northern California.\nTeams typically comprised o
 f architects\, engineers\, contractors\, designers\, corporations\, and lo
 cal elementary school students work together to build giant sand sculpture
 s. The funds raised by teams and sponsors make it possible for us to conti
 nue to provide arts programs to Bay Area students.\n\nThousands of people 
 come out to Ocean Beach for Leap’s annual Sandcastle Classic\, which is 
 free to the public to attend.\n\nThe event is covered by regional print an
 d online media\, and celebrity judges evaluate the final sand sculptures.\
 nMore than 25 local schools and 500 donating companies and advertisers par
 ticipate.\n\nThe highest grossing team in the event’s history raised $60
 \,000.\n\nThis year\, we’re accepting a maximum of 30 teams. Sign up ear
 ly to reserve your spot!\n\nFree\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2
 026/10/24/leaps-44rd-annual-sandcastle-classic-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n
 \nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/leap-arts-annual-sandcastle-c
 lassic/
