DESCRIPTION:We’re just as shocked as you are that this is the first time
  we’ve hosted tarot readings here at Paxton Gate. To rectify this oversi
 ght\, we’re going big and bringing you not one\, but TWO days of reading
 s with the incredibly talented The Southern Oracle!\nShe’ll be offering 
 intuitive tarot readings\, along with guidance and insight into whatever q
 uestions you might have. I (the writer) have plenty of questions myself\, 
 but most of them revolve around things like\, “How do I fit more taxider
 my on my already full wall?” and “Is it worth buying a 3D printer to m
 ake more miniatures when I already have about 10 unopened kits I haven’t
  even painted yet?”\nYour questions are probably a little more consequen
 tial than mine\, but all questions are valid. So\, whether you’re lookin
 g for answers\, a little reassurance about the future\, or just want to se
 e what the cards have to say about your current path in life\, come on by!
 \nThe Southern Oracle will be offering:\n15 Minutes | $25 (Perfect for a q
 uick check-in)\n\n30 Minutes | $50 (Great for exploring specific questions
 )\n\n1 Hour | $100 (For a more in-depth reading)\n\nPlease note: No advanc
 e booking is available for this event. All readings are offered on a first
 -come\, first-served basis\, so we recommend arriving early to secure your
  spot.\n\nPaxton Gate's\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24
 /the-art-of-kokedama-a-hands-on-workshop-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
