 quake Festival. Lit Crawl SF brings together 250+ authors\, 50+ events and
  close to 5\,000 fans for the world’s largest free pop-up literary event
 .\nStarted in 2004\, Lit Crawl cultivates a unique\, resonant brand: smart
  and silly\, worldly and wacky\, with events presented in venues usual (ba
 rs\, cafes\, galleries\, and bookstores) and unusual (tattoo parlors\, bar
 bershops\, and laundromats).\n\nSee the Litcrawl Map for 2026\n\nLit Crawl
  SF 2026\nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026 | 5:00pm–9:00pm | Mission Distric
 t | FREE\nTAILGATE EVE\nPage Street Co-working and The Writers Grotto are 
