DESCRIPTION:October 24\, 2026 @6:00PM and @8:30PM\n\nBrava Main Stage\n\nS
 tep into an immersive courtroom trial. As members of the jury\, the power 
 to deliver justice rests entirely in your hands. Debate the case\, questio
 n the motives and cast your votes throughout the show. Decide who walks fr
 ee... and who pays the price. This is jury duty like you've never experien
 ced it before.\n\nA driverless car has taken a life and someone must answe
 r for it. The programmer who wrote the code\, the passenger who trusted th
 e machine\, or the AI that made the call? There is no precedent. There is 
 no roadmap. There is no easy answer.\n\nOur cases are designed to be chall
 enging\, taking you through more twists and turns than a rollercoaster.\n\
 nIn this courtroom\, you are going to put your moral compass to test. A ca
 se that has no precedents\, no legal roadmaps\, but only questions that th
 is courtroom has never faced before.\n\nPay attention to testimonies\, exh
 ibits and details. Because someone might be playing you... and they might 
 just get away with it.\n\nVote throughout the show and ultimately decide: 
 guilty or not guilty. Will justice be served? Well\, that's up to you.\n\n
 General Info\n\nDates and times: select your date & time directly in the t
 icket selector\n\nLocation: Brava Theater Center\n\nDuration: 60 minutes\n
 \nAge requirement: 12+. Children under the age of 16 must be accompanied b
 y an adult\n\nAccessibility: the venue is ADA compliant\n\nLanguage: Engli
 sh\n\nBring your phone to scan QR codes and participate in key moments of.
 ..\n\n12+\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/the-jury-expe
 rience-the-killer-ai-will-san-francisco-deliver-justice-tickets\nSource: D
 oTheBay
