DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBrittany LambThe Yoga Shala 20
 26 Yoga Teacher Training Cohort Presents: A Seva Fundraiser for The Art of
  Yoga Project\nJoin The Yoga Shala’s current Yoga Teacher Training cohor
 t for a special community yoga class celebrating their graduation through 
 seva — selfless service.\nFor their final project\, our graduating teach
 ers have chosen to give back through the practice they’ve spent the past
  several months learning and living. This special class will raise funds f
 or The Art of Yoga Project\, a Bay Area nonprofit that brings mindfulness-
 based yoga practices to system-involved and marginalized youth\, supportin
 g healing\, resilience and empowerment.\n\nThis class is an invitation to 
 practice together\, celebrate the next generation of yoga teachers\, and s
 upport an organization making yoga and mindfulness accessible to young peo
 ple who need it most.\nCome move\, breathe\, connect and give back.\nAll l
 evels and experience welcome. Bring a friend\, your mat\, and an open hear
 t.\n100% of proceeds from the class will benefit The Art of Yoga Project.\
 nSunday\, October 25\nThe Yoga Shala SF — 2010 Balboa St.\n9:30am-11am\n
 Learn about The Art of Yoga Project here.\nYour practice can be more than 
 something you do for yourself.\nIt can be something you give.\n\n$10.00\n\
