DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerAn evening in honor of Breast 
 Cancer Awareness Month and in celebration of Jewish women\nJoin us for a b
 eautiful evening of connection\, inspiration\, and challah-making as we co
 me together to celebrate the strength and spirit of Jewish women.\n\nLearn
  the art of making and braiding challah from start to finish\, with simple
  tips and tricks for creating delicious\, fool-proof challah at home. Alon
 g the way\, discover the deeper meaning behind the ingredients and traditi
 ons that make challah so much more than bread.\nWe’ll also hear from a l
 ocal breast cancer thriver\, sharing her personal journey and a message of
  strength\, hope\, and resilience.\nTogether\, we’ll take a moment to ho
 nor the women in our lives who have faced breast cancer\, those who are wa
 lking that journey today\, and the families and loved ones who stand besid
 e them.\nYour evening will include:\n* Hands-on challah braiding from star
 t to finish\n* Tips & tricks for delicious\, fool-proof challah\n* An insp
 iring conversation with a local breast cancer thriver\n* The deeper Jewish
  meanings behind the ingredients of challah\n* A challah recipe card to ta
 ke home\n* An opportunity to connect\, celebrate\, and show support for ou
 r sisters\nA portion of the proceeds will benefit Sharsheret\, an organiza
 tion dedicated to supporting women and families facing breast and ovarian 
 cancer.\nCome with a friend\, come for the challah\, and come to be part o
 f something meaningful – an evening of Jewish connection\, sisterhoo...\
 n\n$36.00\n\nTickets: https://www.jewishpetaluma.com/templates/articlecco_
 cdo/aid/6091707/jewish/Pink-Challah-Bake.htm\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap
 .com/pink-challah-bake/\nSource: Funcheap SF
