DESCRIPTION:Join our Monday yoga series on the Back Plaza\, with beautiful
  and peaceful views overlooking the Bay!\n\nAn hour of yoga during your lu
 nch hour is a great way to get out of your office\, love your body in comm
 unity\, reconnect to your breath\, listen to soulful tunes\, and recharge 
 your energy for the day. We’re so glad you choose to spend this precious
  time with us!\n\nThis vinyasa yoga classes combine accessible and creativ
 e flows\, dynamic stretching\, and core work. All-levels flow moves at a s
 teady\, accessible pace so you can slow down\, connect to each movement an
 d breath\, while still offering some challenge. Headphones are provided to
  create an immersive sound experience\, so it’s easy to hear the teacher
 \, to stay present with the practice\, and to enjoy a mix of zen and fun s
 oulful beats!\n\nPlease bring your own mat.\n\nTickets: https://www.ferryb
 uildingmarketplace.com/events/monday-yoga/var/ri-9.l-L1\nDetails: https://
 dothebay.com/events/2026/10/26/monday-yoga-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
