DESCRIPTION:After Dark: Creepatorium\nThursday\, October 29 | Exploratoriu
 m\, Pier 15\n\nGet ready for some hair-raising fun at our annual Halloween
  party! Embrace your dark side with Gothicumbia and dress to impress at th
 e science-themed costume contest.\n\nThis Halloween\, face your fears at t
 he Creepatorium—and discover the science behind what scares us. From ins
 ects to heights\, explore the evolution of our survival instincts guided b
 y experts. Play with special Halloween-themed exhibits\, observe our world
 -famous cow eye dissection\, and get creative at the annual costume contes
 t. Plus\, bring out your inner Goth by dancing to cumbia\, darkwave\, post
 -punk\, and more with Los Goths Co.\n\nAre you afraid of the dark?\nEmbrac
 e your fears inside the world-famous Tactile Dome!\nImmerse yourself in to
 tal darkness by walking\, crawling\, climbing\, and sliding your way throu
 gh this interactive sculpture—but there's even more lurking just around 
 the corner. Explore the mystery textures and curious noises all around you
 \, and take your Halloween to the next level with this thrilling yet not-t
 oo-scary experience.\n\nAfter Dark Thursday Nights\nThis event is part of 
 our After Dark Thursday Nights series. Unplug and play with 700+ interacti
 ve exhibits exploring science\, art\, and perception. Learn more.\n\n6–1
 0 p.m.\nAdults Only (Ages 18+)\nThe Exploratorium\, Pier 15\, San Francisc
 o\n\n18+\n\nTickets: https://www.exploratorium.edu/visit/calendar/after-da
 rk-creepatorium\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/29/after-dar
 k-creepatorium-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
