BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bug's Eye View (Online Event)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T210000
DTSTAMP:20261021T171908Z
UID:dothebay-17979063@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:Look closely on your next Bay Area hike and you may discover a
 n entire world hiding in plain sight.\nJoin POST and entomologist Eddie Du
 nbar for a live online event exploring the surprising lives of Bay Area in
 sects. Meet some of the tiny neighbors you may encounter outdoors\, look b
 eyond the idea of insects as pests and see what their stories can teach us
  about the natural world.\n\nWhat you’ll explore:\n- The important roles
  insects play in Bay Area habitats and the web of life\n\n- Local insects 
 and the behaviors\, adaptations and relationships that make them unique\n\
 n- How slowing down and looking closely helps you spot more insect life on
  the trail\n\n- Live Q&A: ask Eddie your insect questions\n\nYou’ll leav
 e with:\n- A new appreciation for the insects sharing our open spaces\n- A
  better understanding of why healthy\, connected habitats matter for wildl
 ife of every size\n- Fresh inspiration to explore the Bay Area with a more
  curious eye\n\nYour speaker: Eddie Dunbar\, MBA\, is an entomologist\, fo
 under and president of the Insect Sciences Museum of California and an adj
 unct professor at Merritt College. He brings scientific expertise\, humor 
 and curiosity to California’s remarkable insect life.\n\nWhen: Thursday\
 , October 29\, 7:00 to 8:15 p.m.\nWhere: Online\n\nRegister today for an e
 vening of small wonders and wild stories.\n\nFree – Register Online\nPen
 insula Open Space Trust Presents:\n\nTickets: https://openspacetrust.org/e
 vent/bugs-eye-view-online-event/?utm_campaign=bugs_eye&utm_medium=listing&
 utm_source=landis&utm_content=referral\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/even
 ts/2026/10/29/bug-s-eye-view-online-event-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7726402;-122.4099154
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35065050/79990654-9077-4915-8461-6a633a4a7492.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T171908Z
LOCATION:Online\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/29/bug-s-eye-view-online-event-tic
 kets
