 e through the halls. Delight in bites from Off the Grid food trucks\, mood
 y cocktails\, and immersive photo moments around every corner.\n\nCome dre
 ssed in your most art-inspired\, avant-garde costume\, and prepare for a w
 ickedly unforgettable night.\n\nTickets are limited and will vanish fast 
 — reserve yours before they sell out.\n\nEvent details\n\nGeneral admiss
 ion: $45\; VIP: $95\nGuests must be 21+ years of age.\nCapacity is limited
