 nsferable.\nTicket includes access to Treasures of the Pharaohs and the de
  Young’s permanent collection galleries. Exhibition access is not guaran
 teed.\nThis event features amplified live DJ music. Attendee discretion is
  advised.\nAdmission starts at 6 pm.\nAudio tours are not available during
  Late Night Editions: Halloween Eve.\nCostume safety and guidelines\nBy pu
