BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Haunted Chinatown Cocktail Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T210000
DTSTAMP:20261015T212936Z
UID:dothebay-17957185@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Experiences
DESCRIPTION:The Spirits & Spirits tour takes guests through the dimly lit\
 , haunting alleys of San Francisco's Chinatown\, tracing the historic cock
 tail route from the city's notorious Barbary Coast days. Ghostly tales and
  dark history blend seamlessly with crafted spirits and cocktails along th
 e way. Highlights include iconic eerie locations like the Great Star Theat
 er\, where spectral figures and the Lady in White linger\, alongside the t
 ragic legends surrounding Ross Alley and St. Louis Alley.\n\nDuring the co
 cktail experience\, guests visit vibrant local lounges and hidden watering
  holes along the route to enjoy themed\, craft drinks while guides recount
  bone-chilling tales of notorious gangster Little Pete\, the Cameron House
 \, and wandering souls. Its the ultimate evening out for history lovers\, 
 thrill-seekers\, and cocktail enthusiasts. First Mai Tai included\, with o
 pportunities to purchase cocktails and mocktails at subsequent stops.\n\nS
 tretchy Pants Food Tours Presents:\n\nTickets: https://www.stretchy-pants.
 com/#october30\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/30/haunted-ch
 inatown-cocktail-tour-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7905703;-122.4055726
