DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerDance FridaysFri\, Oct 30\, 7:
 45pm to Sat\, Oct 31\, 1:30am. Doors 7:45pm\; dance lessons begin 8pm.\nCe
 lebrate Halloween Friday with Julio Bravo y su Orquesta Salsabor live and 
 three rooms of Salsa\, Bachata and Cumbia at Dance Fridays in San Francisc
 o. Explore the live salsa room\, a dedicated bachata dance floor and a cum
 bia room\, then dance into Halloween until 1:30am.\nFour dance lessons are
  included with admission\, with beginner-friendly options and intermediate
  bachata for dancers ready for more. Lessons begin at 8pm. No partner or e
 xperience is needed for the beginner lessons. Come solo\, bring a date or 
 invite friends\; arrive early\, learn new moves and join the party.\nCostu
 mes are strongly encouraged but not required. A silent costume contest bri
 ngs awards throughout the night. Enjoy spacious hardwood dance floors\, ni
 ghtclub sound and lighting\, a full bar and an outdoor patio.\nFriday\, Oc
 tober 30\, 2026: doors open at 7:45pm\; lessons start at 8pm\; dancing con
 tinues until 1:30am on Saturday\, October 31. Dance Fridays is at 550 Barn
 eveld Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94124. Ages 21+ with valid ID. Free park
 ing nearby\; do not leave valuables in your car.\nTickets start at $20 plu
 s fees while the customer-appreciation tier is available. Current listed t
 otals are $21.99 customer appreciation\, $32.90 early bird and $43.45 gene
 ral admission\, including fees. Prices increase by tier and availability i
 s limited. Reserve through Eventbrite.\nAll ticket purchases\,...\n\n$22.0
 0\n\nTickets: https://dancefridays10-30-26.eventbrite.com\nDetails: https:
 //sf.funcheap.com/dance-fridays-halloween-live-salsa-bachata-cumbia-3-room
 s/\nSource: Funcheap SF
