BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Solidarity Cinema: Queer Monstrocities - Early Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T220000
DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:dothebay-17952915@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Activism
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Halloween at this screening & fundraiser supporting 
 mutual aid for trans people and local public media\n\nJoin KALW on Friday\
 , October 30 for a special Halloween edition of Solidarity Cinema\, with s
 creenings at 8:00 and 9:30 PM.\n\nThis month\, we'll be screening four sho
 rt horror short films that explore queerness and monstrosity. As always\, 
 this screening is a fundraiser for mutual aid and all funds raised tonight
  will be donated to TGIJP and local public media! Start your Halloweekend 
 off right with some queer art and community care!!\n\nTerror Sisters (dir.
  Alexis Langlois\, 2019) / 27m\nPYOTR495 (dir. Blake Mawson\, 2016) / 15m\
 nSteak Dinner (dir. Nathan Mark Ginter\, 2025) / 7m\nSPRINGS (dir. Morgan 
 Healani Mein\, 2025) / 14m\n\nSolidarity Cinema is a community-run archive
  of more than 9\,000 films documenting solidarity\, struggle\, and social 
 movements around the world. By providing free access to radical cinema and
  supporting grassroots screenings\, the project helps organizers\, educato
 rs\, and communities use film as a tool for learning\, collective action\,
  and social change.\n\nKALW Public Media\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.
 io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fsolidarity-cinema-queer
 -monstrosities-tickets-2002476288484%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator%26keep_tld%3Dtr
 ue\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/30/solidarity-cinema-quee
 r-monstrocities-early-show-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n-
  https://sf.funcheap.com/free-halloween-queer-horror-short-films-queer-mon
 strocities-kalw-sf/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34943553/748fd280-051c-4d28-badb-98d1e7b2a752.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T194441Z
LOCATION:KALW @ 220 Montgomery\, 220 Montgomery St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94104
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/30/solidarity-cinema-queer-monstro
 cities-early-show-tickets
END:VEVENT
