SUMMARY:Spooky Science at Chabot (Oakland)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T170000
DTSTAMP:20261023T050002Z
UID:funcheap-1642579@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerChabot StaffSpend your Hallowe
 ekend at Chabot!\nTrick or Treat across the universe and enjoy some ooey-g
 ooey spooky science! Join us for a variety of fun and family-friendly Hall
 oween activities including a Spooky Science Lab\, the Pumpkin Elevator Eng
 ineering Challenge\, and more! Wear a costume\, get some candy\, and learn
  more about physics\, biology\, engineering\, and\, of course\, outer spac
 e.\nTimed activities will include a Pumpkin Drop from Chabot’s roof at 1
 :30 pm\, and the grand premiere of a new short film about our hunt for dar
 k matter\, followed by a live panel Q&A with scientists from the Lawrence 
 Berkeley National Laboratory at 2:30 pm.\n\nTimed Activities\n11AM-1PM & 2
 -4PM | Spooky Science Lab in Lab 2\nOoey\, gooey\, sticky\, and spooky! Co
 me experiment in our laboratory with various science activity stations. Re
 commended for ages 4 and up.\n11AM-1PM & 2-4PM | Pumpkin Elevators Enginee
 ring Challenge in Classroom 2\nDesign your own elevator to lift a mini-pum
 pkin in this engaging engineering challenge. Recommended for ages 6 and up
 .\n1:30-2PM | Pumpkin Drop in the Courtyard\nWatch pumpkins splat on the c
 ourtyard from the roof… for science! All ages.\n2:30-3PM | How to Search
  for the Unseen: The Hunt for Dark Matter at Berkeley Lab\nWatch the grand
  premiere of a brand-new short film about our hunt for dark matter\, follo
 wed by a live panel Q&A with scientists from the Lawrence Berkeley Nationa
 l Laboratory\n\n$24.00\n\nTickets: https://chabotspace.org/calendar/spooky
 -science/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/spooky-science-chabot-oakland/
 \nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Spooky
 -Astronomy-banner.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T050002Z
LOCATION:Chabot Space & Science Center\, 10000 Skyline Boulevard Oakland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/spooky-science-chabot-oakland/
END:VEVENT
