DESCRIPTION:Fisherman’s Wharf Community Benefit District\, Into The Stre
 ets & the Port of San Francisco present\n1st Annual Wags & Wheels\nSaturda
 y\, October 31 | ​Fisherman's Wharf\n\nDogs in Halloween costumes. A lin
 eup of beautiful classic cars decked out for Trunk or Treat. And a waterfr
 ont Halloween celebration for the whole crew. The first annual Wags & Whee
 ls brings dog lovers\, families\, and friends to Fisherman’s Wharf for a
  day of free entertainment\, playful activities\, and shopping\, with dona
 tion-based costume contests and Trunk or Treat benefiting the San Francisc
 o SPCA.\n\nFree and open to all ages. Dogs and humans are encouraged to co
 me in costume. Trunk or Treat passes and costume contest entries each star
 t at a $5 sliding-scale donation benefiting the San Francisco SPCA.\n\nEVE
 NT HIGHLIGHTS:\n\nDogs and humans in costume: Live contests with categorie
 s celebrating Fisherman’s Wharf\, car culture\, Halloween spirit\, and g
 roup costumes. “Three-Legged Legends & Friends” welcomes pups of all s
 hapes\, sizes\, and abilities. Winners can accept cash prizes or donate th
 eir winnings to the San Francisco SPCA in their dog’s name.\nClassic-car
  Trunk or Treat: Families collect treats from a row of decorated classic c
 ars. Donation-based passes include face painting and entry into the Hot Wh
 eels Boogie Racer station.\nFree activities and entertainment: An all-day 
 doggy disco with live DJs\, a dog run\, lawn games\, demos\, and photo opp
 ortunities with a Giant Corgi Butt.\nPet marketplace: Pet food\, gear\, ac
 ces...\n\nFree\nFisherman’s Wharf Community Benefit District\, Into The 
 Streets & the Port of San Francisco present\n\nTickets: https://consumer.p
 xf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fwags-wheels-tickets-
 2001412375291%3Faff%3DDoTheBay\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/
 10/31/1st-annual-wags-wheels-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\
 n- https://sf.funcheap.com/free-wags-wheels-halloween-dog-pawty-trunk-trea
 t-classic-cars-fishermans-wharf/
