  Free (Oct. 31-Nov. 1)\nAquarium of the Bay\nAquarium of the Bay hosts its
  Fish or Treat Halloween program at PIER 39 on October 31 and November 1\,
  featuring underwater pumpkin carving from 1-2 PM\, otter pumpkin enrichme
 nt at 2 PM\, and an all-day arts and crafts table. A trick-or-treat candy 
 station is offered on October 31 only. Children ages 12 and under wearing 
 costumes receive free general admission\, subject to limitations.\nAdult a
 dmission is $33.66\, but Bay Area adults w/ valid ID get 15% off tickets p
 urchased in person (not valid online) so they’ll pay around $29 and get 
 around $5 off.\nOriginal Event Description:\nSomething spooky is swimming 
 into the Bay! 🎃🌊\nJoin us for Fish or Treat\, October 31–November 
 1 at PIER 39!\nPIER 39 The Embarcadero &\, Beach St\, San Francisco\, CA 9
 4133\nOctober 31-November 1\, 2026\n🎃 Underwater Pumpkin Carving | 1–
 2 PM\n🦦 Otter Pumpkin Enrichment | 2 PM\n🎨 Arts & Crafts Table | All
  day\nOctober 31 only:\n🍬 Trick or Treat Candy Station\nKids 12 and und
 er wearing a costume receive FREE admission October 31–November 1.*\nGen
 eral Admission for adult is $33.66 – but bay area locals can get 15% off
  tickets with valid ID – only for purchase in person (locals discount no
 t available for online purchases) – so adults would be approximately $28
 .61 – about $5 off\nLocals Discount\nIf you live in one of the nine San 
 Francisco Bay Area counties*\, you qualify for the locals discount of 15% 
 off!\nTo receive this s...\n\n$29.00\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com
 /p/Dd93le_yYLZ/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp\;stkn=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\nDe
 tails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-aquarium-of-the-bay-underwater-pumpkin-
 carving-w-kids-free-oct-31-nov-1/\nSource: Funcheap SF
