DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:funcheap-1642634@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Featured photo by Sachi CunninghamHeavy Water Collective Prese
 nts: Ocean Beach brings together 24 photographers who turn their lenses to
 ward the Pacific\, finding pockets of magic amidst a vast liquid field of 
 chaos.\n\nSome of these works play with the juxtaposition of ocean wildern
 ess and concrete cityscapes\, framing surfers speeding down powerful waves
  with electrical wiring and concrete in the foreground. Others ask you to 
 forget the city and immerse in how light\, energy\, and human shapes can d
 ance together. Each photograph displays a single permutation within an inf
 inite\, ever-changing landscape.\n\nWe invite you to share the awe and app
 reciation we have for this beach and enjoy taking in a different dimension
  of San Francisco.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.harveymilkphotocenter.o
 rg/events/heavy-water-collective-presents-ocean-beach/\nDetails: https://s
 f.funcheap.com/free-ocean-beach-photo-exhibit-24-bay-area-photographers-sf
 /\nSource: Funcheap SF
