DESCRIPTION:With Shelby Devlin\n\nRavishment is a hands-on\, interactive c
 lass that teaches lovers how to create and enjoy the kind of passionate en
 counters often found in the steamy chapters of romance literature. We will
  focus on enhancing physical and emotional connection\, emphasizing the ar
 t of building anticipation\, and creating a safe space for exploring domin
 ance and submission (D/s).\nEmbark on a journey of discovery and connectio
 n with Ravishment. Through learning the basics of D/s\, you will open the 
 door to a more passionate\, intimate\, and fulfilling relationship. Transf
 orm the way you connect with your partner(s)\, embracing the power and bea
 uty of consensual ravishment.The workshop is five hours of instruction\, 1
 0AM until 4PM\, with an hour-long break for lunch. You are welcome to brin
 g a lunch and make use of the fridge and microwave\, order delivery\, or l
 eave the event space for lunch. While the workshop is physically interacti
 ve for couples\, the level of 'activity' is up to you. We will not be usin
 g props\, bondage gear\, or toys\, but we will be using our bodies. This i
 s a clothing-on event.\n\nLearning Objectives\nIntroduction to D/s Dynamic
 s: Learn the principles of dominance and submission\, emphasizing the impo
 rtance of consent and mutual respect. Explore different D/s archetypes and
  how they can be adapted to fit your unique relationship dynamic. Learn ho
 w to set boundaries and ensure that all activities are enjoyable and conse
 nsual for everyone.\nExpressive Communication: Master t...\n\n$315.99 to $
 522.95\nShelby Delvin\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3
 A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fravishment-mastery-of-erotic-dominance-pas
