BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Growing Up on the Hippie Trail: Caleb Dardick at Adobe Books
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T200000
DTSTAMP:20261023T171442Z
UID:dothebay-17979218@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Literature
DESCRIPTION:What was it like to grow up in the counterculture — from the
  back seat of a VW bus?\n\nJoin author Caleb Dardick at Adobe Books for a 
 free reading and discussion of his new memoir\, The Adventures of Superfre
 ak: My Childhood on the Hippie Trail (Running Wild Press\, 2026).\n\nIn 19
 70\, five-year-old Caleb traveled from Amsterdam to India with his parents
  and two younger siblings. His father used a wheelchair\, his mother was l
 iving with undiagnosed bipolar disorder\, and the family embarked on a 20\
 ,000-mile adventure through Europe\, North Africa\, the Middle East\, and 
 India.\n\nFunny\, adventurous\, and deeply personal\, the memoir explores 
 the counterculture through a child's eyes\, capturing both the wonder and 
 instability of an extraordinary family journey.\n\nA longtime Bay Area res
 ident who wrote much of the book in Berkeley\, Dardick returns to San Fran
 cisco as the city approaches the 60th anniversary of the Summer of Love in
  2027.\n\nSaturday\, November 7\, 2026 | 6:00–7:30 PM\nAdobe Books\n3130
  24th Street\, San Francisco\n\nFree admission — no RSVP required. Books
  available for purchase and signing.\n\nMore information: https://calebdar
 dick.com/events/\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/events/16066
 92613998437\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/7/growing-up-on-
 the-hippie-trail-caleb-dardick-at-adobe-books-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\
 nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/free-book-reading-childhood-hi
 ppie-trail-adobe-books/
GEO:37.7526501;-122.4148227
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35065997/a81670ce-389e-40d4-a795-2a5020ee4f92.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T171442Z
LOCATION:Adobe Books on 24th\, 3130 24th St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/7/growing-up-on-the-hippie-trail-c
 aleb-dardick-at-adobe-books-tickets
END:VEVENT
