 ransforms Irving Street (9th–11th Ave.) into a lively community space an
 d market filled with vintage and secondhand treasures\, artists and makers
 \, community organizations\, and more.\n\nTwo blocks of vendors\, live mus
 ic\, and free family-friendly activities all surrounded by the unique shop
 s and eateries of the Inner Sunset neighborhood. And for the first time\, 
 each market features a unique theme and interactive experiences to make th
 e day even more special.\n\nInner Sunset Flea Market 2026 Season Schedule\
