 y”\nJUNE 14th – “Celebrating Pride♡”\nJULY 12th – “Garden Pa
 rty”\nAUGUST 9th – “Dog Days of Summer”\nSEPTEMBER 13th – “A T
 aste of Comedy Day”\nOCTOBER 11th – “Tricks\, Treats\, & Treasures
 ”\nNOVEMBER 8th – “The Big Lunch & Annual Pie Contest”\n\nFree\n\n
