DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBodhi meditation SF🥗 Good F
 ood · Hands-On Fun · Gifts & Prizes · ❤️ Positive Energy\nLooking f
 or a fun and relaxing way to spend your Sunday?\n\nCome celebrate with us 
 at Bodhi Meditation San Francisco! Bring your family and friends for a wel
 coming day of food\, creativity\, meaningful experiences\, and community c
 onnection.\nWhether you’re visiting for the first time or have been part
  of our community for years\, everyone is welcome!\nWhat’s Happening:\n
 🥗 Healthy Food & Tastings — Enjoy a selection of delicious foods.\nDI
 Y Energy Bracelets — Create your own colorful bracelet to take home.\n
 ❤️ Energy Blessing Experience — Enjoy a peaceful moment to slow down
  and relax.\nTraditional Oracle Lots & Guidance — Explore a traditional 
 blessing practice and enjoy a one-on-one conversation for reflection and f
 resh perspectives.\nWishes & Blessings — Share a heartfelt wish for your
 self or someone you love.\nStamp Challenge\, Gifts & Lucky Draw — Explor
 e activity stations\, collect stamps\, and enjoy chances to win surprises!
 \nSpecial Gift: Guests who join an Energy Blessing session can receive a p
 urple crystal bead as a keepsake\, while supplies last.\nThis special gath
 ering also celebrates Medicine Buddha’s Birthday\, a traditional occasio
 n associated with wishes for health\, peace\, compassion\, and happiness.\
 n✨ No meditation experience or religious background is needed. Stop by f
 or an hour or enjoy the whole afternoon at your own pace!\nSunday\, Novemb
 er 8\, 2026\n⏰ 10:00 AM–3:00...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventb
 rite.com/e/2003528294061?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.c
 om/free-2026-wellness-fest-food-tastings-diy-bracelets-sf/\nSource: Funche
 ap SF
