DESCRIPTION:The Tech InteractiveBig ideas. Hands-on fun. Free admission!\n
 Celebrate National STEM Day at The Tech Interactive with a full day of cur
 iosity\, creativity\, and discovery! On Sunday\, Nov. 8\, explore the wond
 ers of science\, technology\, engineering\, and math with exciting activit
 ies\, special community partners\, and immersive IMAX® films. Whether you
 ’re a budding engineer\, a lifelong learner\, or just love discovering s
 omething new\, there’s something for everyone.\nThanks to generous suppo
 rt from Micron\, admission is FREE for all guests!\n\nWhat to Expect\n– 
 Free admission: Explore The Tech’s interactive exhibits and discover you
 r inner innovator.\n– Hands-on STEM labs (1 to 4 p.m.): Get creative wit
 h Cabbage Paints\, explore The Physics of Roller Coasters\, and put your c
 uriosity to work.\n– Free IMAX® films: Experience educational films on 
 the largest dome screen in the Bay Area\, with screenings at 12:30\, 1:30\
 , 2:30\, 3:30\, and 4:30 p.m.\n– Community activities and giveaways: Con
 nect with local Silicon Valley organizations offering bonus activities\, f
 un surprises\, and opportunities to explore STEM.\nBring your family\, inv
 ite a friend\, and get ready to experiment\, play\, and discover something
  amazing together!\nNational STEM Day is sponsored by Micron.\nParking is 
 Easy\nReceive $5 parking validation when you park at the Convention Center
  Garage or 2nd & San Carlos Garage and present your same-day ticket at Vis
 itor Services. (Excludes City-designated Special Event days.)\nLocation: T
 he Tech Inter...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/events/169376/
 t/tickets\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/national-stem-day-tech-interac
 tive-free-admission-san-jose/\nSource: Funcheap SF
