BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:You're Just a Thing: The Art of Objectification with Miss Red Rida
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T210000
DTSTAMP:20261021T171908Z
UID:dothebay-17977212@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:Class: 7–9:30pm · Play: 9:30–10:30pm · $75/couple · $40
 /single\n\nA footstool. A coat rack. A pretty little decoration. Why is it
  so hot to be reduced to a thing\, and so satisfying to treat someone like
  one?\n\nMiss Red Rida and her sub Sparrow Lark come from both sides of th
 e D/s dynamic\, and they'll show you how to do it well. You'll explore wha
 t pulls tops and bottoms toward objectification\, try out its many flavors
  and styles\, and learn how it's different from degradation and humiliatio
 n.\n\nCome ready to be furniture\, or to furnish your space with a willing
  body. You might be the chair someone sinks into\, the table that holds th
 eir drink perfectly still\, the lamp that glows on command\, or the hook t
 hey hang their keys on when they walk through the door. Or you might be th
 e one choosing where your thing goes and how long it stays there.\n\nYou'l
 l brainstorm objectifying words and try them out on each other\, get into 
 human furniture positions\, and play games that turn people into props. Th
 e class ends with an hour of open play where you can put your thing to use
 !\n\nThe exercises are made for pairs\, and solo observers are welcome.\n\
 nWhat to wear: Whatever feels comfy and sexy to you. The class involves so
 me basic movement.\n\nAbout Miss Red Rida\nMiss Red Rida (she/they) is a q
 ueer\, disabled Dominatrix and kink educator based in Montréal. They have
  been working as a kink provider since 2021 and began offering kink and co
 nsent workshops in 2024. She enjoys indulging in the art of negotia...\n\n
 Miss Red Rida\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fw
 ww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fyoure-just-a-thing-the-art-of-objectification-with
 -miss-red-rida-tickets-2003680758085\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/11/11/you-re-just-a-thing-the-art-of-objectification-with-miss-red-r
 ida-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35056844/2fefa4d0-49fa-4c38-a60a-544c3fe7ba13.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T171908Z
LOCATION:The Kink Store SF\, 224 6th St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/11/you-re-just-a-thing-the-art-of-
 objectification-with-miss-red-rida-tickets
END:VEVENT
