DESCRIPTION:November 13\, 2026 @6:30PM\n\nBrava Theater\n\nCelebrate the K
 ing of Pop's legendary career through a collection of his greatest hits. F
 rom Billie Jean to Thriller and Man in the Mirror\, rediscover Michael Jac
 kson's unforgettable music through the warm glow of Candlelight!\n\nThis c
 oncert experience is a tribute. It is not associated with\, endorsed by or
  sponsored by the artist\, their heirs or their official representatives.\
 n\nProgramme: I Want You Back\, Rock With You\, Human Nature\, Billie Jean
 \, Say Say Say\, We Are the World\, Man in the Mirror\, Smooth Criminal\, 
 Black or White\, Heal the World\, Remember the Time\, Bad\, Earth Song\, T
