UID:dothebay-17821509@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Arts & Family
DESCRIPTION:This is Your City. This is Your Voice. This is Your Future. Sh
 are your story about growing up and raising your family in San Francisco.\
 n\nEvery family has a story. Every voice matters. Please share yours.\n\nJ
 oin us for the District 4 Sunset Family Summit! The This Is Your City: Fam
 ily Summit Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and commu
 nity members from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our cit
 y.\n\nSaturday\, Nov. 14\, 2026\, 11:00 a.m. - 1:30 p.m.\n\nSunset Recreat
 ion Center\, 2201 Lawton St\, SF\, CA 94122\n\nFree food\, childcare\, and
  interpretation are provided. Please note all interpretation requests must
  be made 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit.\n\nWho should attend
 ? Everyone is welcome. This event highlights District 4\, but you can atte
 nd any Family Summit that fits your schedule.\n\nWhy are we gathering? The
  Family Summit Series is part of San Francisco's first Citywide Community 
 Needs Assessment. Through conversations with families across the city\, we
 're learning what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults\, and fa
 milies. What we learn will help improve future planning\, programs\, and s
 ervices.\n\nWhether you've lived in San Francisco your whole life or recen
 tly made it your home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\n\nDistrict 4 N
 eighborhoods include: Central Sunset\, Outer Sunset\, Parkside\, Pine Lake
  Park\, Lakeshore\, Merced Manor\, and Farallon Islands\n\nFree\nSan Franc
 isco Department of Children\, Youth & Their Families (DCYF)\n\nTickets: ht
 tps://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fdist
 rict-4-sunset-family-summit-tickets-1996549226482%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nD
 etails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/district-4-sunset-family-su
 mmit-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.c
 om/district-4-sunset-family-summit/
