DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSFPLDraw in a calm and support
 ive community space for all levels (including you!). Doodle\, practice\, e
 xperiment with new materials\, or finish that drawing/comic/manga page you
 ’ve been procrastinating on. This is a great place to try something new\
 , make mistakes (the fuel of creativity!) and have fun. All styles and ski
 ll levels encouraged.\nThis is a drop-in\, free-form session\, but an opti
 onal drawing prompt will be offered to get you started. There won’t be i
 nstruction\, but please keep an eye out for our upcoming series of drawing
  classes.\n\nBasic drawing materials (paper\, pencils\, etc.) provided. Yo
 u’re also welcome to bring your own supplies\, but please no fume-creati
 ng pens or paints.\nThis event takes place in the Main Library (100 Larkin
  Street)\, on the 4th Floor in the Steve Silver Music Center.\n\nFree\n\nT
 ickets: https://sfpl.org/events/2026/11/14/activity-drawn-together-drawing
