DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of art\, wine & cheese\, and a one-of
 -a-kind opportunity to acquire an original painting by Victoria Lashkareff
 \, a Russian émigré artist whose work was exhibited throughout Northern 
 California during the mid-20th century.\n\nNow\, a curated selection from 
 this remarkable collection will be offered for purchase at our Silent Art 
 Auction. Browse original works\, enjoy a glass of wine\, and bid on a piec
 e that catches your eye.\n\nWith starting bids from $50\, this is an oppor
 tunity to own an original work of 20th-century art while supporting the cu
 ltural programs of the Museum of Russian Culture and the Russian Center of
  San Francisco.\n\nTickets\, Online Art Gallery\, & Event Details availabl
 e at: https://www.russiancentersf.org/event-details/silent-auction-at-the-
 russian-center.\n\n$10.00\n\nTickets: https://www.russiancentersf.org/even
 t-details/silent-auction-at-the-russian-center\nDetails: https://dothebay.
 com/events/2026/11/14/silent-art-auction-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
