DESCRIPTION:Ideas Worth Sharing\, Right Here in Hayes Valley\nWhat is TEDx
 HayesValley? And what might be ahead?\n\nJoin us for our first TEDxHayesVa
 lley Salon\, a free\, commitment-free gathering for anyone curious about T
 ED\, TEDx\, and the ideas we’ll be bringing to Hayes Valley.\n\nWe’ll 
 spend time together watching a selection of our favorite TED Talks\, shari
 ng thoughts and conversation\, and getting to know others who are excited 
 about the power of ideas worth sharing. We’ll also share more about what
 ’s ahead for TEDxHayesValley\, including upcoming events and ways to get
  involved.\n\nWhether you’re a longtime TED fan\, new to TEDx\, part of 
 the Hayes Valley community\, or simply curious about what comes next\, we
 ’d love to have you join us.\n\nThis event is free\, but seating is limi
 ted to 125 people and available on a first-come\, first-served basis.\nCom
 e curious. Leave inspired. And get a first look at what’s next for TEDxH
 ayesValley.\n\nParking Information: There is no dedicated parking and stre
 et parking can take time to find. You may wish to Uber or pay for parking 
 nearby and walk over. (110 Franklin\, 98 Franklin are the closest options\
 ; 360 Grove is further\, but always has room)\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://
 consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Ftedxhayesv
 alley-salon-tickets-2003029625530\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/20
 26/11/14/tedxhayesvalley-salon-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
