BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Clift Royal Sonesta Hotel Continues Its Speaker Series: Making
  History Fun Again
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T190000
DTSTAMP:20261023T050002Z
UID:dothebay-17973354@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:The Clift Royal Sonesta Hotel\, a San Francisco landmark since
  1915\, continues its monthly speaker series\, Making History Fun Again\, 
 with “San Francisco’s Media Evolution\,” a conversation with journal
 ists and media leaders who have helped tell the city’s stories across ge
 nerations and platforms.\nOn Thursday\, November 19\, Heather Knight\, San
  Francisco bureau chief for The New York Times\, will moderate a panel fea
 turing Will Hearst\, editor and publisher of Alta Journal\; award-winning 
 television journalist Wendy Tokuda\; political reporter Joe Fitzgerald Rod
 riguez of The San Francisco Standard\; and radio host and political commen
 tator John F. Rothmann.\nFrom newspaper dispatches to television broadcast
 s\, radio conversations and news delivered through smartphones\, San Franc
 isco’s media have chronicled a city defined by reinvention. Earthquakes\
 , local politics\, cultural movements\, housing challenges and unforgettab
 le personalities have provided generations of journalists with stories tha
 t resonate far beyond the Bay Area.\nBringing together perspectives from p
 rint\, television\, digital news and radio\, the evening will explore how 
 the city’s stories reach audiences\, how journalism has changed and what
  endures as new technologies reshape the media landscape. Guests will hear
  from people who have brought Bay Area news into homes\, onto doorsteps\, 
 over the airwaves and into the palm of a hand.\nThe complimentary event be
 gins with non-hosted cocktails at 5:00 p.m.\, followed by the program fro.
 ..\n\nFree\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/the-clift-ro
 yal-sonesta-hotel-continues-its-speaker-series-making-history-fun-again-ti
 ckets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/clif
 t-royal-sonesta-hotel-speaker-series-making-history-fun-5/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35039363/19cbc405-630b-473f-bfc2-09dceabbf96a.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T050002Z
LOCATION:The Clift Royal Sonesta Hotel\, 495 Geary Street\, San Francisco\
 , CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/the-clift-royal-sonesta-hotel-c
 ontinues-its-speaker-series-making-history-fun-again-tickets
END:VEVENT
