BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Reimagining the Future with Psilocybin Mushrooms with Paul Stamets
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T210000
DTSTAMP:20261015T212936Z
UID:dothebay-17957271@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:CIIS Public Programs presents renowned mycologist and medical 
 researcher Paul Stamets for an illuminating talk on the history of psilocy
 bin mushrooms exploring their past\, present\, and future uses. In this pr
 esentation\, Paul takes you on a journey into the psilocybin mycosphere as
  he chronicles milestones that further substantiate that psilocybin\, and 
 more so psilocybin mushrooms\, can help us evolve into the best of what we
  can be.\n\nThe collection and cultivation of psilocybin mushrooms\, Paul 
 argues\, is central to our practices for freedom of consciousness. Paul sh
 ares how psilocybin mushrooms might fundamentally change the many challeng
 es we face as a society. He believes we are at an evolutionary crossroads.
  Could psilocybin mushrooms help propel us as we emerge into a new version
  of ourselves\, Homo sapiens 3.0?\n\nPaul Stamets\, D.Sc. (Honoris causa) 
 is a speaker\, author\, mycologist\, medical researcher\, and entrepreneur
 \, who is considered an intellectual and industry leader in fungi. He is t
 he founder and owner of Fungi Perfecti\, LLC\, and Host Defense Mushrooms 
 supplement line. Paul Stamets is the author of eight books. He named numer
 ous new species of psilocybin mushrooms. In 2023\, a new psilocybin mushro
 om species was named after him to honor his lifelong work: "Psilocybe stam
 etsii." He is an invention ambassador for the American Association for the
  Advancement of Science (AAAS) and was inducted into The Explorer's Club i
 n 2020. He has received numerous awards\, including th...\n\n$50-$71.\nCII
 S Public Programs\n\nTickets: https://bit.ly/stametsciis26\nDetails: https
 ://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/reimagining-the-future-with-psilocybin-m
 ushrooms-with-paul-stamets-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34965134/ef9fc8c9-051a-4564-a9e1-410711732939.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261015T212936Z
LOCATION:Sydney Goldstein Theater\, 275 Hayes St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94
 102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/reimagining-the-future-with-psi
 locybin-mushrooms-with-paul-stamets-tickets
END:VEVENT
