SUMMARY:The Music of Hey Arnold Live! Feat. Jim Lang & the PS 118 AllStars
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261124T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261124T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17742724@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nThe Music of Hey Arnold
  Live! Featuring Jim Lang & the PS 118 AllStars\nwith special guest Craig 
 Bartlett\n\nTuesday\, November 24 | The Castro\n\nThe Music of Hey Arnold!
  Live featuring Jim Lang & The PS 118 AllStars celebrates the 30th anniver
 sary of one of television’s most cherished animated series.\n\nLed by aw
 ard winning composer Jim Lang\, best known for his unforgettable theme mus
 ic\, original songs\, and score for Hey Arnold!\, this one of a kind conce
 rt brings the music of the series to life on stage. Blending jazz\, hip ho
 p\, blues\, R&B and funk\, Lang created a sound unlike anything else on te
 levision\, helping give Hey Arnold! its heart\, warmth\, humor and soul. T
 hirty years later\, the music continues to connect with fans of all ages a
 nd inspire musicians around the world.\n\nPerformed by Jim Lang and The PS
  118 AllStars\, the evening features the show’s unforgettable themes\, f
 an favorite songs\, and some of the moments that made Hey Arnold! so speci
 al. Accompanied by multimedia visuals and stories from behind the music\, 
 the performance also includes a special guest appearance by series creator
  Craig Bartlett.\n\nWhether you grew up with Hey Arnold! or are discoverin
 g its music for the first time\, this 30th anniversary celebration is a ch
 ance to experience one of animation’s most distinctive and enduring scor
 es performed live by the composer who created it.\n\nAll ages\nSold out\nA
 nother Planet Entertainment presents\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: htt
 ps://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3
 A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%2Fthe-music-of-hey-arnold-live-san-francisco-c
 alifornia-11-24-2026%2Fevent%2F1C00650F4E9F2E64%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPL
 ANET_web%26brand%3Danotherplanet\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/202
 6/11/24/the-music-of-hey-arnold-live-feat-jim-lang-and-the-ps-118-allstars
 -with-special-guest-craig-bartlett-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33952339/1404298d-e5ff-4bff-9b69-776dbc1cd2be.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
