DESCRIPTION:We’re throwing our 30th annual member party\, and we want to
  celebrate you! Connect with the community that’s at the heart of the Sa
 n Francisco Bicycle Coalition\, plus enjoy prizes\, local food vendors\, g
 ames\, art activities\, and more.\nReady to reconnect with the amazing bik
 e community that makes our movement so special? Let’s come together and 
 celebrate! Don’t miss out on an incredible evening at SOMArts including:
 \nComplimentary drink ticket with every ticket purchase.\nArts & crafts.\n
 Silent auction is back! Bid on art\, bikes\, and gear.\nComplimentary snac
 ks plus delicious food for purchase.\nNot a member? This is your perfect o
 pportunity to dive into the biking community and join the movement. To ren
 ew your membership or become a monthly giver\, please go to sfbike.org/joi
 n or email us membership@sfbike.org.\nYour ticket price supports putting o
 n this event and our work to create safe streets and make biking an access
 ible option for all San Franciscans.\nTICKETS COMING SOON!\nSPONSORSHIP OP
 PORTUNTIES\nWant to sponsor this event? Your cash sponsorship supports saf
 er streets and more livable communities for all San Franciscans. Check out
  our sponsor benefits and contact development@sfbike.org to request more i
 nformation and pledge your support!\nFor more details about the event\, ch
 eck out our Winterfest page.\n\nPublished by San Francisco Bicycle Coaliti
 on\nContains information from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n
 \nDetails: https://sfbike.org/event/winterfest-2026-sfbike-party-at-somart
 s-934-brannan-st/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-
 francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261015T113924Z
LOCATION:SOMArts\, 934 Brannan St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, United States
