DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer“Healthy Parks Healthy Peopl
 e”: Monthly Nature Walks | Bay Area\nPhoto | Healthy Parks Healthy Peopl
 e\nEnjoy a free\, monthly outdoor walk on the first Saturday of every mont
 h as part of the “Healthy Parks\, Healthy People” program.\nFirst Satu
 rday Programs are introductory walking/physical activity programs that occ
 ur on the first Saturday of each month throughout the Bay Area.\n\nPlease 
 note that occasionally these events are canceled in the winter or due to w
 et weather. Please always double check on the website first to ensure this
  month’s event is still taking place.\nUpdated 5/28/19 – Event info la
 st checked via website\n\nUpcoming “Healthy Parks Healthy People”: Mon
 thly Nature Walks | Bay Area Events\nSat 11/7 “Healthy Parks Healthy Peo
 ple”: Monthly Nature Walks | Bay AreaSat 12/5 “Healthy Parks Healthy P
 eople”: Monthly Nature Walks | Bay AreaSat 1/2 “Healthy Parks Healthy 
 People”: Monthly Nature Walks | Bay AreaDisclaimer: Please double check 
 event information with the event organizer as events can be canceled\, det
 ails can change after they are added to our calendar\, and errors do occur
 .\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfrecpark.org/recprogram/healthy-parks-healt
 hy-people/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/healthy-parks-healthy-people-
 monthly-nature-walks-bay-area-119/\nSource: Funcheap SF
