SUMMARY:District 10 Bayview Family Summit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T130000
DTSTAMP:20261007T210655Z
UID:dothebay-17821514@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Arts & Family
DESCRIPTION:This is Your City. This is Your Voice. This is Your Future. Sh
 are your story about growing up and raising your family in San Francisco.\
 n\nEvery family has a story. Every voice matters. Please share yours.\n\nJ
 oin us for the District 10 Bayview Family Summit! The This Is Your City: F
 amily Summit Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and com
 munity members from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our c
 ity.\n\nSaturday\, Dec. 5\, 2026\, 11:00 a.m. - 1:30 p.m.\n\nSoutheast Com
 munity Center\, ● 1550 Evans Ave\, SF\, CA 94124\n\nFree food\, childcar
 e\, and interpretation are provided. Please note all interpretation reques
 ts must be made 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit.\n\nWho should
  attend? Everyone is welcome. This event highlights District 10\, but you 
 can attend any Family Summit that fits your schedule.\n\nWhy are we gather
 ing? The Family Summit Series is part of San Francisco's first Citywide Co
 mmunity Needs Assessment. Through conversations with families across the c
 ity\, we're learning what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults\
 , and families. What we learn will help improve future planning\, programs
 \, and services.\n\nWhether you've lived in San Francisco your whole life 
 or recently made it your home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\n\nDist
 rict 10 Neighborhoods include: Potrero Hill\, Central Waterfront\, Dogpatc
 h\, Bayview-Hunters Point\, Bayview Heights\, India Basin\, Silver Terrace
 \, Candlestick Point\, Visitacion Valley\, Little Hollywood\, Sunnydale\, 
 and McLa...\n\nFree\nSan Francisco Department of Children\, Youth & Their 
 Families (DCYF)\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2
 Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fdistrict-10-bayview-family-summit-tickets-199655
 0486250%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/1
 2/5/district-10-bayview-family-summit-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso li
 sted on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/district-10-bayview-family-summit/
