BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Anna Voloshyna\, Ukraïne
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T130000
DTSTAMP:20261007T210655Z
UID:dothebay-17901104@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Shopping
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\, 11:00 am - 11:45 am\n\nStop by 
 the Foodwise Classroom for a cooking demo featuring the seasonal bounty of
  the Ferry Plaza Farmers Market.\n\nAnna Voloshyna is a Ukrainian-American
  culinary storyteller\, activist\, and author of Ukraïne: Recipes and Sto
 ries from Kyiv to the Black Sea and BUDMO! Recipes from a Ukrainian Kitche
 n. Raised in Ukraine\, her cooking style blends traditional Eastern Europe
 an and Ukrainian recipes with modern influences\, showcasing her dedicatio
 n to nourishing dishes and high-quality ingredients. Anna honed her culina
 ry expertise at the San Francisco Cooking School\, where she completed the
 ir Culinary Arts program.\n\nAnnas expertise in Ukrainian and Eastern Euro
 pean foods has led to features in top publications such as The New York Ti
 mes\, The Washington Post\, and Food and Wine\, as well as participation i
 n various culinary projects and speaking engagements. Committed to sharing
  her culinary knowledge\, Anna hosts culinary events\, both in-person and 
 online cooking classes and workshops. Her contributions to the culinary ar
 ts have earned her accolades\, including the IACP Media Award and the Fore
 word Indies Best Indie Cookbook Award.\n\nAll demos take place in the Food
 wise Classroom (green tent in front of the Ferry Building) and are free to
  the public\, with recipes and samples for all.\n\nThe demo will be follow
 ed by a book signing with book sales courtesy of Book Passage\n\nTickets: 
 https://foodwise.org/events/anna-voloshyna-ukraine/\nDetails: https://doth
 ebay.com/events/2026/12/5/anna-voloshyna-ukraine-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34701332/67478649-83d0-4d1a-a599-6ab193c91b8f.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T210655Z
LOCATION:Ferry Plaza
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/5/anna-voloshyna-ukraine-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Drawing From Film—Night of the Hunter
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T130000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638191@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSFPLWe’ll be pausing Laughto
 n’s Southern Gothic thriller\, Night of the Hunter\, to draw striking fr
 ames. We’ll be focusing on the art deco design\, dramatic shadows and po
 ses in the film.\nBasic materials (pencils\, paper\, erasers) will be prov
 ided. You may bring your own materials\, but please no fume-creating paint
  or paint pens. Watercolor\, ink and gouache are fine.\n\nThis is a self-l
 ed event\; there will be no instruction or feedback. However\, there will 
 be an opportunity at the end of the session to look at others’ drawings 
 and show your own.\nPG\, 92 mins.\, 1955. Closed captions (CC) in English.
  Due to pauses for drawing\, the full film will not be shown.\nThe event t
 akes places in the Main Library at 100 Larkin Street\, in the Latino/Hispa
 nic Meeting Room.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfpl.org/events/2026/12/05/a
 ctivity-drawing-film-night-hunter\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/drawin
 g-filmnight-hunter/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DFF-Ni
 ght-of-the-Hunter.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:San Francisco Main Public Library\, 100 Larkin St\, San Francisco
 \, CA 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/drawing-filmnight-hunter/
END:VEVENT
