DESCRIPTION:Madrone Art BarMadrone Art Bar is seeking local artists\, make
 rs\, and creatives for its Holiday Market on December 5\, 2026. The event 
 aims to feature a curated mix of handmade\, independently designed\, and v
 intage goods. Vendor applications are open until September 28. The market 
 will be held at 500 Divisadero St in San Francisco. Space is limited\, and
  selection will be based on diversity of products and styles.\nOriginal Ev
 ent Description:\n_🎁 CALL FOR VENDORS! 🎁\nWe’re looking for local 
 artists\, makers\, and creatives to join us at the Madrone Holiday Market 
 on Saturday\, December 5th!\nWe’re curating an eclectic mix of handmade 
 and independently designed goods (art\, ceramics\, jewelry\, textiles\, zi
 nes\, accessories\, home goods\, vintage/upcycled pieces\, holiday gifts\,
  and other creative finds).\n📅 Saturday\, December 5th – TIME TBD\n
 📍 Madrone Art Bar | 500 Divisadero\nWhether you’re a seasoned market 
 vendor or this would be your first time selling your work\, we’d love to
  hear from you!\nSpace is limited\, and vendors will be selected to create
  a varied mix of products\, styles\, and price points.\n✨ Vendor applica
 tions are open through September 28th!\n🔗 Apply through the link in our
  bio.\nKnow someone who would be a great fit? Tag your favorite local arti
 sts and makers below! 👇_\nText extracted from provided image:\nCALL FOR
  VENDORS\nMadrone Holiday Market\nSaturday\, December 5th\nMadrone Art Bar
 \nArtists • Makers • Creatives\nVendor applications now open\nApply vi
 a link in bio\n500 Divisadero St. • Sa...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://ww
 w.instagram.com/p/DcefbJpS59S/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp\;igsi=NTc4M
 TIwNjQ2YQ==\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/madrone-art-bar-2026-holiday
 -market-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
