DESCRIPTION:HEAD WEST Holiday Marketplace\nSunday\, December 6 | Ferry Bui
 lding\n\nJoin HEAD WEST Marketplace on Sunday\, December 6th at the iconic
  SF Ferry Building from 11am–5pm!\n\nFind us on the Ferry Building back 
 plaza\, right on the water with epic views — at the base of multiple fer
 ry lines connecting from around the Bay!\n\nFeaturing:\n\nSHOP SMALL from 
 Local Makers\, Crafters\, Artists\, Designers & Vintage Merchants — read
 y to share their newest finds\, creations and collections with you.\nEAT +
  DRINK from all of your local favorite eateries\, bakeries and more in the
  Ferry Building main marketplace + find treats on the back plaza with us!\
 nEnjoy LIVE MUSIC playing all day\nand more!\n\nHEAD WEST is always FREE E
 NTRY\nALL Are Welcome\nPet + Kid-Friendly\nBring your Friends\, Family & F
 urbabes!\n\nCome for the Marketplace. Stay for the Experience.\n\nHEAD WES
 T is an Outdoor Marketplace of Makers\, Crafters\, Artists\, Designers + V
 intage Merchants rooted in the Bay Area.\n\nEach marketplace is light rain
  or shine.\nAll outdoor venues are kid + pet friendly\, with ADA Accessibl
 e entrances and maintained portable/public restrooms for use.\n\nThe San F
 rancisco Ferry Building has always been committed to the artisan food + ma
 ker community\, by fostering the values of the community. Collectively\, t
 his historic landmark venue holds a vibrant gathering of local farmers\, a
 rtisan producers\, and independently owned and operated small businesses a
 nd the customers they serve. It is a community of like-minded people who s
 upport...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.headwestmarketplace.com/ferrybui
 lding\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/head-west-marketplac
 e-at-ferry-building-1773793326\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- htt
 ps://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-sunset-holiday-mercantile-2026-100-makers-food-tr
 ucks-live-music-dec-5-6-2/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/30899505/64486a53-df3f-445e-a65d-6ce70ff5c991.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T214235Z
LOCATION:Ferry Building\, One Ferry Marketplace\, San Francisco\, CA\, 941
 11
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/head-west-marketplace-at-ferry-b
 uilding-1773793326
