BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flaming Creatures: The Films of Jack Smith
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T090000
DTSTAMP:20261021T171908Z
UID:dothebay-17977347@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Buy Tickets\n\nDoors 6:30pm / Screening 7pm\n\n$15 / free or d
 iscounted for members\n\nCurated & presented by Bradford Nordeen in associ
 ation with Dirty Looks\, The Lab and San Francisco Cinematheque\n\nThis pr
 ogram was initially organized in collaboration between Dirty Looks and LA 
 Filmforum\n\nThis screening is dedicated to Agosto Machado (????–2026)
 —“a lady never tells.”\n\nJack Smith was an underground visionary in
  every sense of the word. Jack poured glitter into everything he made: pas
 ty creatures\, plastic fantasias and moldy monsters. He was a performance 
 artist\, filmmaker\, playwright\, photographer\, socialist\, aesthete\, in
 stallation artist\, scene-stealer\, writer\, interventionist. He built a t
 heater and movie-studio in his rickety loft out of street debris\; an intr
 icate and child-like universe\, Cinemaroc\, was equal parts Baroque and br
 oke. For a contingency of art and theater fags and dolls\, Jack\, as Charl
 es Ludlam once eloquently put it\, “is the daddy of us all.” And quixo
 tically\, the fact that he remains a somewhat underground or cult figure\,
  as opposed to canonized creature\, attests to his legacy.\n\nBest known a
 s a filmmaker\, Jack made wild\, indeterminable pictures. Flaming Creature
 s was his first finished film. Well\, in truth\, it’s his only finished 
 film\, since it ricocheted out of his hands when a trend of underground fi
 lm raids made his opus a trophy for either side of a decency debate. Seize
 d at the same time as Jean Genet’s Un chant d’amour (1950) and Kenneth
  Anger’s Scorpio...\n\n$15\n\nTickets: https://link.dice.fm/raeb2ea55d0d
 \nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/10/flaming-creatures-the-fi
 lms-of-jack-smith-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.765289;-122.418493
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35057515/d81f50eb-35d5-4b27-81dd-ab7e7d1d8abd.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T171908Z
LOCATION:The Lab\, 2948 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/10/flaming-creatures-the-films-of-
 jack-smith-tickets
END:VEVENT
