UID:dothebay-17821515@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Arts & Family
DESCRIPTION:This is Your City. This is Your Voice. This is Your Future. Sh
 are your story about growing up and raising your family in San Francisco.\
 n\nEvery family has a story. Every voice matters. Please share yours.\n\nJ
 oin us for the District 3 Chinatown Family Summit! The This Is Your City: 
 Family Summit Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and co
 mmunity members from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our 
 city.\n\nSaturday\, Dec. 12\, 2026\, 11:00 a.m. - 1:30 p.m.\n\nBetty Ann O
 ng Recreation Center\, 1199 Mason St\, SF\, CA 94108\n\nFree food\, childc
 are\, and interpretation are provided. Please note all interpretation requ
 ests must be made 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit.\n\nWho shou
 ld attend? Everyone is welcome. This event highlights District 3\, but you
  can attend any Family Summit that fits your schedule.\n\nWhy are we gathe
 ring? The Family Summit Series is part of San Francisco's first Citywide C
 ommunity Needs Assessment. Through conversations with families across the 
 city\, we're learning what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults
 \, and families. What we learn will help improve future planning\, program
 s\, and services.\n\nWhether you've lived in San Francisco your whole life
  or recently made it your home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\n\nDis
 trict 3 Neighborhoods include: Barbary Coast & Northern Waterfront\, China
 town\, Lower Nob Hill\, Financial District\, Fisherman’s Wharf\, Jackson
  Square\, Nob Hill\, North Beach\, Polk Gulch\, Russian Hill\, Telegraph H
 ill\, an...\n\nFree\nSan Francisco Department of Children\, Youth & Their 
 Families (DCYF)\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2
 Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fdistrict-3-chinatown-family-summit-tickets-19965
 51616631%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/
 12/12/district-3-chinatown-family-summit-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso
  listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/district-3-chinatown-family-summit/
