SUMMARY:MoAD: Museum of the African Diaspora Free Museum Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T170000
DTSTAMP:20261012T211826Z
UID:funcheap-1642135@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:MoAD: Museum of the African Diaspora Free Museum Day (SF)\nMOA
 D\nMoAD\, a contemporary art museum\, celebrates Black cultures\, ignites 
 challenging conversations\, and inspires learning through the global lens 
 of the African Diaspora.\nMonthly Free Day\nMoAD hosts a ‘‍THRIVE @ Mo
 AD Community Day’ every second Saturday with free admission to all of it
 s exhibitions. Check the events calendar to confirm\, as free days sometim
 es change.\nMoAD Hours\nMonday – CLOSED\nTuesday – Sunday\, 11 am – 
 5 pm\nThursday – Noon to 8 pm\n‍\nAdmission\n– General Admission –
  $15\n– Seniors\, Students\, Educators – $7\n– Youth (Under 12) – 
 Free\n– Members & Active Duty Military – Free\n\nVisiting with kids:\n
 Kids and families receive a warm welcome at MoAD. Our elevator makes it ea
 sy to navigate with a stroller\, and kids ages 12 and under always receive
  free admission.\nMuseums For All:\nVisit MoAD through Museums for All\n
 – Through Museums for All\, those receiving food assistance (SNAP benefi
 ts) can gain free or reduced admission to more than 700 museums throughout
  the United States simply by presenting their EBT card. Free entry is avai
 lable for up to 4 individuals per EBT card.\n\nSpecial Exhibitions for 202
 6\nContinuum: MoAD Over TimeMoAD ArtistsOctober 1\, 2025 – March 1\, 202
 6Museum of the African Diaspora (MoAD)A special exhibition highlighting th
 e evolution of MoAD artists over time.\n\nUNBOUND: Art\, Blackness & the U
 niverseCurated by Key Jo LeeOctober 1\, 2025 – August 16\, 2026Museum of
  the African Diaspora (MoAD)Spanning a...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.
 moadsf.org/visit\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/moad-museum-of-the-afri
 can-diaspora-free-museum-day-sf-46/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/62ea74
 7d1e6f2da1381bac86_MoAD-Building_Exterior_Compressed.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261012T211826Z
LOCATION:Museum of the African Diaspora\, 685 Mission St\, San Francisco\,
  CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/moad-museum-of-the-african-diaspora-free-museu
 m-day-sf-46/
END:VEVENT
