BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Florencia Ramirez\, The Kitchen Activist
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T130000
DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:dothebay-17901105@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Shopping
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, December 19\, 2026\, 11:00 am - 11:45 am\n\nStop by
  the Foodwise Classroom for a cooking demo featuring the seasonal bounty o
 f the Ferry Plaza Farmers Market.\n\nFlorencia Ramirez is the author of Th
 e Kitchen Activist: Your Step-by-Step Guide to Creating a Planet Smart Kit
 chen and Eat Less Water: The Solution to Water Shortages is in the Kitchen
 . A storyteller at heart and researcher by training\, she holds a masters 
 degree in public policy from the University of Chicago. Through writing\, 
 research\, and lived experience\, she explores how the everyday choices we
  make in our kitchens can become acts of environmental and social change. 
 Her work has been featured on NPR\, PBS\, KTLA\, CBS\, KCRWs Good Food\, a
 nd in the Los Angeles Times. She is the founder and Executive Director of 
 the Pesticide Free Soil Project and the recipient of the Environmental Her
 o Award and the Gift of Freedom Award in Creative Nonfiction. Married and 
 the mother of three Kitchen Activists\, she splits her time between Oxnard
 \, California\, and Santa Fe\, New Mexico.\n\nAll demos take place in the 
 Foodwise Classroom (green tent in front of the Ferry Building) and are fre
 e to the public\, with recipes and samples for all.\n\nThe demo will be fo
 llowed by a book signing with book sales courtesy of Book Passage\n\nTicke
 ts: https://foodwise.org/events/florencia-ramirez-the-kitchen-activist/\nD
 etails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/19/florencia-ramirez-the-kitch
 en-activist-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34701337/9b0b5c65-54cf-4b97-b465-3ab95e6d42b0.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T194441Z
LOCATION:Ferry Plaza
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/19/florencia-ramirez-the-kitchen-a
 ctivist-tickets
END:VEVENT
