SUMMARY:Community Investments Committee Meeting - December 22\, 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261222T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261222T150000
DTSTAMP:20261023T171442Z
UID:dothebay-16737772@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:The San Francisco Arts Commission is committed to open governm
 ent. Any member of the public is welcome to attend our meetings and provid
 e public comment.\n\nCommunity Investments Committee meetings are held the
  fourth Tuesday on even-numbered months at 1 p.m.\, and generally last for
  about two hours. If the scheduled date falls on a holiday\, the meeting w
 ill usually be rescheduled to the following or preceding week.\n\nSee the 
 City's website to view the meeting agenda\, which is posted 72 hours in ad
 vance\, and for instructions on how to join a meeting.\n\nACCESSIBLE MEETI
 NG POLICY\n\nPer the Americans with Disabilities Act and the Language Acce
 ss Ordinance\, Chinese\, Spanish\, and/or American Sign Language interpret
 ers will be available upon request. Additionally\, every effort will be ma
 de to provide a sound enhancement system\, meeting materials in alternativ
 e formats\, and/or a reader. Minutes may be translated after they have bee
 n adopted by the Commission.\n\n利便参與會議的相關規定\n\n根
 據美 國殘疾人士法案和語言服務條例，中文、西班牙語
 、和/或美國手語翻譯人員在收到要求後將會提供翻譯服
 務。另外，我們將盡力提供擴音設備。同時也將會 提供
 不同格式的會議資料， 和/或者提供閱讀器。此外，翻譯
 版本的會議記錄可在委員會通過後提供。\n\nPOLITICA DE ACCE
 SO A LA REUNIÓN\n\nDe acuerdo con la Ley sobre Estadounidenses con Discap
 acidades (Americans with Disabilities Act) y la Ordenanza de Acceso a Idio
 mas (Language Access Ordinance) intérpretes de chino\, español\, y lengu
 aje de señas estarán disponibles de ser requeridos. En adición\, se har
 á todo el esfuerzo posible para proveer un sistema mejoramiento de sonido
 \, materiales de la reunión en...\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/12/22/community-investments-committee-meeting-december-22-2026-ticke
 ts\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7795732;-122.42101
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/29161535/1e76cd22-ce98-4d60-9d1c-60b856d0f7c9.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T171442Z
LOCATION:San Francisco Arts Commission Gallery\, 401 Van Ness Ave\, San Fr
 ancisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/22/community-investments-committee
 -meeting-december-22-2026-tickets
END:VEVENT
