DESCRIPTION:Asian Art Museum: Free Admission Day (Every First Sunday)\nAsi
 an Art Museum\nThrough the power of art\, the Asian Art Museum in San Fran
 cisco brings the diverse cultures of Asia to life.\nLocated in the heart o
 f San Francisco\, the museum is home to one of the world’s finest collec
 tions of Asian art\, boasting more than 18\,000 awe-inspiring artworks ran
 ging from ancient jades and ceramics to contemporary video installations.\
 n\nFree First Sundays\nTypically the first Sunday of the month (dates migh
 t be moved due to holidays)\n10am to 5pm\nAsian Art Museum\, 200 Larkin St
 reet\, SF\nFREE admission (first come first served)\; tickets to special e
 xhibitions are offered at a discounted price of $10\nRSVP + Tickets Requir
 ed\n– Find future dates on this calendar\n– Please note that links gen
 erally will be live about a month in advance\n\nFree Day Details\n\nFree F
 irst Sunday Admission for main galleries: Normally $20 for general admissi
 on\, the museum offers free general admission every first Sunday the month
  on “Free First Sundays“.\nSunday Hours: Sunday admission hours are ty
 pically 10am to 5pm – but please check the Asian’s Plan your Visit pag
 e for any updates.\nFree Docent-led tours: Typically there are free docent
 -led tours every Sunday at 11am. Check out “Free Daily Tours“\nFree St
 reet Parking – Yup! Like much of SF\, the meters around the Asian Art Mu
 seum don’t charge on Sundays. Always double check with your meter just i
 n case.\nVery rarely\, the museum might switch the dates of the “Free Fi
 rst Sunday”...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://about.asianart.org/plan-your-
 visit/?utm_campaign=PlanYourVisit&amp\;utm_medium=funcheap&amp\;utm_source
 =funcheap\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/asian-art-museum-free-admissio
 n-day-every-first-sunday-68/\nSource: Funcheap SF
