UID:funcheap-1641676@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:SF’s Cartoon Art Museum’s “Pay What You Wish” Day (Fir
 st Tuesdays)\nCartoon Art Museum\nFounded in 1984\, the Cartoon Art Museum
  has something for everyone—from comic strips\, comic books and anime to
  political cartoons\, graphic novels and underground comix. People of all 
 ages can view original cartoon art at exhibitions and screenings\, produce
  their own comics and animation at classes and workshops\, research deeply
  into our collection and library\, and mix and mingle with professional an
 d aspiring cartoonists. This unique institution houses approximately 7\,00
 0 original pieces in our permanent collection and attracts more than 30\,0
 00 visitors annually.\nFirst Tuesday “Pay What You Wish” Day\nFirst Tu
 esdays | 11 am to 5 pm\nCartoon Art Museum\, 781 Beach Street\, San Franci
 sco\nFREE Admission\nPay What You Wish Days create affordable experiences 
 for all to ignite imaginations and foster the next generation of visual st
 orytellers by celebrating the history of cartoon art\, its role in society
 \, and its universal appeal with a visit to the Cartoon Art Museum. Set yo
 ur own admission price and find inspiration through viewing original art\,
  exploring the reading room or enjoying family-oriented activities in thei
 r kids corner.\nCartoon Art Museum Admission\n\nAdults – $10\nSan Franci
 sco Resident – $7\nStudents/Senior/Military/Educator (with valid ID) –
  $6\nKids (6-12) – $4\nChildren (5 and Younger) – FREE\nCartoon Art Mu
 seum Members – FREE\nThe first Tuesday of every month is our Pay What Yo
 u Wish Day....\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.cartoonart.org/visit\nDetai
 ls: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-cartoon-art-museums-pay-what-you-wish-day-
 first-tuesdays-34/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/154398
 19_10154650476372787_559204237688024280_n-1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T104232Z
LOCATION:Cartoon Art Museum\, 781 Beach Street\, San Francisco\, Californi
 a 94109
